 add('No actual outstanding-vote estimate is supplied. Issued-minus-returned, registration-minus-ballots and precincts-reporting percentages do not identify uncounted valid candidate votes. A live input must state its source/time/category/acceptance status and a conditional remaining candidate pool, keeping counted A/B and **each named other candidate** fixed. Ballot pool→contest participation and other-candidate participation require separate explicit assumptions. [Official mail processing guidance](https://www.sos.state.co.us/pubs/elections/FAQs/mailBallotsFAQ.html), [current rules](https://www.sos.state.co.us/pubs/rule_making/CurrentRules/8CCR1505-1/ElectionRules.pdf).')
 add('For remaining valid candidate votes U and other share o, U_pair=U(1−o). FINAL pair denominator=countedA+countedB+U_pair; FINAL all-candidate denominator=countedA+countedB+countedOthers+U. Required remaining A pair share for target pair margin g is [U_pair+g·FINAL_pair−counted_pair_lead]/(2U_pair). The multi-unit interface solves a selected remaining unit with all others fixed at their supplied volumes/preferences. Shares clip visibly; unknown/negative/no-pool/impossible/secured and unspecified other allocation remain distinct. [Offline implementation](data/baselines/calculate.py), [16 synthetic saved scenarios](data/baselines/live-scenarios.json). These demonstrate arithmetic, not a fitted or calibrated model.')
